sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OS as OS / Process
    participant Main as main.py
    participant Bootstrap as bootstrap.py
    participant Warmup as Model Warmup
    participant Adapters as AI Adapters (Det/Emb/Liv)
    participant Server as GrpcServer
    actor Client as NestJS Client

    Note over Main, Server: Giai doan 1: Khoi tao va Warm-up (Startup)
    OS->>Main: python main.py
    Main->>Bootstrap: bootstrap_app(warmup=True)
    Bootstrap->>Adapters: Khoi tao Adapter (Detector, Embedder, Liveness)
    Bootstrap->>Server: Khoi tao GrpcServer va dang ky Servicer
    Bootstrap->>Warmup: warmup_models(container)
    Warmup->>Adapters: Detector.warmup() (load ONNX, forward dummy)
    Warmup->>Adapters: Embedder.warmup() (load ArcFace, forward dummy)
    Warmup->>Adapters: Liveness.warmup() (load Session, forward dummy)
    Warmup-->>Bootstrap: Hoan tat warm-up (tat ca model san sang)
    Bootstrap-->>Main: ApplicationContainer

    Note over Main, Server: Giai doan 2: Dang ky Signal va Khoi dong Server
    Main->>Main: signal.signal(SIGINT/SIGTERM, graceful_shutdown)
    Main->>Server: server.start()
    Main->>Server: server.wait_for_termination()
    Server->>Client: Lang nghe RPC tai 0.0.0.0:50051

    Note over OS, Server: Giai doan 3: Graceful Shutdown
    OS->>Main: Gui tin hieu SIGINT / SIGTERM
    Main->>Server: server.stop(grace=5.0)
    Note over Server: Tu choi request moi, cho in-flight RPCs hoan tat
    Server-->>Main: Shutdown hoan tat, dong ThreadPool
    Main-->>OS: Process exit 0
